{
  "$description": "Direction A, Light workshop, final. Chrome colours never change; site colours are the default Slack Water theme and every site owner can edit them, choosing only from the curated tones listed under site-tones. Shadows, the scrim and the drag hatching reuse Graphite, Steel, Key and Alloy with transparency; the selection toolbar shadow reuses the accent. The accent is Tool yellow, approved on 1 October 2026: a light colour, so what sits on it, the keyline around it, accent-coloured text and thin lines are graphite (--on-mark, --mark-key, --mark-ink and --mark-line in styles.css). Switching sets --mark in styles.css (every mark the editor draws reads it, the top-bar mark included); mark.svg, the favicon file, repeats the hex as text, and so does this file.",
